<title>VENEZUELA: Vencemos yr net up 34 pct.</title>
<headline>Vencemos yr net up 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 47.5 bln bolivars vs 35.4 bln</p>
<p>Net sales 161.9 bln bolivars vs 136.4 bln</p>
<p>Cost of sales 90.8 bln bolivars vs 78.9 bln</p>
<p>Admin costs 15.1 bln bolivars vs 12.5 bln</p>
<p>Financing gain 6.2 bln bolivars vs 3.6 bln</p>
<p>Notes: Results to period ending Dec 31 are consolidated but preliminary and not audited.</p>
<p>All figures expressed in constant Dec 31 bolivars</p>
<p>Venezuela's Vencemos Corporation SA is a cement producing subsidiary of Mexican cement group Cemex SA.  </p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
